		<Strength>6</Strength>
		<Dexterity>5</Dexterity>
		<Weight>5</Weight>
		<Speed>4</Speed>
		<BioText>Born of a bear father and a viking mother, Bodvar lived a true hero’s life.  His mighty hammer and flashing sword protected the Norse folk from every terrifying monster and marauder that menaced the fjords. As reigning Champion of Champions in Valhalla, he is the paragon of warrior spirit and has devoted himself to the prestige and glory of the eternal contest.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Sword</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Cowgirl">
		<HeroID>4</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>CASSIDY</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>CASSIBOT</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>PistolUser,HammerUser,Female</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Cassidy</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[378]Cassidy_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Cowgirl</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Cassidy</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>Pistol</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>PistolSmashCowgirl</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>High Noon</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Hammer</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>HammerSmashCowgirl</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Dust Devil</PowerName2>
		<Strength>5</Strength>
		<Dexterity>8</Dexterity>
		<Weight>3</Weight>
		<Speed>4</Speed>
		<BioText>No U.S. Marshal ever caught more crooks and killers than Cassidy Miller. Sure shooting, heavy hitting Cassidy single-handedly brought the hammer of justice down on some of the most dangerous desperadoes in the Old West. For her, Valhalla is a chance to improve her skills - to get faster, more accurate, and harder to hit. Even in the afterlife, she’s always on the lookout for suspicious types and thinks trouble is brewing.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Pistol</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Valkyrie">
		<HeroID>5</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>ORION</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>ORBOT</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>LanceUser,SpearUser,Male</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Orion</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[546]Volst_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Valkyrie</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Volst</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>RocketLance</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>LanceSmashSpaceKnight</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Blaze of Honor</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Spear</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>SpearSmashSpaceKnight</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Shining Jet Slash</PowerName2>
		<Strength>4</Strength>
		<Dexterity>5</Dexterity>
		<Weight>6</Weight>
		<Speed>5</Speed>
		<BioText>Knight Prime of the 13th Armored Space Fleet, Orion and his fellow Knights Stellar piloted their Griffin Class Warbots to victory against the Oort Empire Invasion. He led his team in the vicious hand to hand warfare during the Battle of Luna and went on to single-handedly smash the Oort Lichking’s transdimensional throne. In Valhalla he’s thrilled to be able to show off his knightly prowess without the fate of the world on his shoulders.</BioText>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Alien">
		<HeroID>6</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>LORD VRAXX</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>ROBRAXX</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>LanceUser,PistolUser,Male</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Vraxx</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[462]Vraxx_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Alien</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Vraxx</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>RocketLance</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>LanceSmashAlien</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Selenite Sling</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Pistol</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>PistolSmashAlien</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Raygun Rampage</PowerName2>
		<Strength>4</Strength>
		<Dexterity>7</Dexterity>
		<Weight>3</Weight>
		<Speed>6</Speed>
		<BioText>For centuries the Selenites, led by Lord Vraxx, waged war against the Martians. In 1938 he finally chased them to Earth, defeating the Martian tripods at last, but Lord Vraxx fell in the Battle of Grover’s Mill. Waking up in a human heaven didn’t slow the Alien Overlord down for more than a moment. He’s as determined to conquer the Tournament as he was the solar system, and may have his one eye on Odin’s throne as well.</BioText>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Caveman">
		<HeroID>7</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>GNASH</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>GNASHOMATON</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>HammerUser,SpearUser,Male</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Gnash</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[336]Thrulk_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Caveman</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Thrulk</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>Hammer</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>HammerSmashCaveman</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Heavy Rock Slam!</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Spear</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>SpearSmashCaveman</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Sharp Stick Slam!</PowerName2>
		<Strength>6</Strength>
		<Dexterity>3</Dexterity>
		<Weight>5</Weight>
		<Speed>6</Speed>
		<BioText>Chieftain of the prehistoric Mammoth Clan, Gnash’s prowess as hunter and tracker knew no equal in his time or in any era since. He could track a tiger’s trail during a thunderstorm, and lay low the beast with a single punch if needed. No one has been in Valhalla longer, and some say he was hunting these heavenly forests before Odin company arrived. He talks little about the tournament (or anything else), but his winning record speaks louder than any grunted words ever could.</BioText>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Witch">
		<HeroID>8</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>QUEEN NAI</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>NAIBORG</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>SpearUser,KatarUser,Female</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_QueenNai</NameSound>
