		<BaseWeapon1>Spear</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>SpearSmashWitch</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Jaws of the Coatl</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Katar</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>KatarSmashWitch</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Wings of the Serpent</PowerName2>
		<Strength>7</Strength>
		<Dexterity>3</Dexterity>
		<Weight>7</Weight>
		<Speed>3</Speed>
		<BioText>An ancient Mayan Sorceress, Queen Nai’s mastery of magic and warfare built and empire for her and her people. In life she commanded spirits and brought dire curses on her foes. Those powers have not abandoned her in the afterlife of Valhalla. This strange world of foreign gods vexes her. She relished every opportunity to vent her frustrations in the arena, where her spells make her one of the most formidable competitors.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Spear</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Ninja">
		<HeroID>10</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>HATTORI</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>BOTTORI</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>SwordUser,SpearUser,Female</MissionTags>
