		<SpecialPower1>SwordSmashNinja</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Vengeance is Mine</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Spear</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>SpearSmashNinja</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Deadly Distraction</PowerName2>
		<Strength>3</Strength>
		<Dexterity>6</Dexterity>
		<Weight>3</Weight>
		<Speed>8</Speed>
		<BioText>The deadliest blade to ever emerge from the Iga Ninja Clan, Hattori speaks only in cryptic poetry, uttered in demonic whispers. She became an unstoppable force for vengeance when she made a pact with a demon in order to learn the identities of those samurai lords who had betrayed her clan. Within the tournament of Valhalla she is a swift and terrifying presence, hell-bent on victory at all costs. At night she has been known to slip out beyond the walls and into the dangerous world of giants and monsters, but she always returns, and is always ready for another challenge.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Sword</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Knight">
		<HeroID>11</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>SIR ROLAND</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>SIR ROLBOT</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>LanceUser,SwordUser,Male</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_SirRoland</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[252]Hotspur_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Knight</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Hotspur</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>RocketLance</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>LanceSmashKnight</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>By the Sword</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Sword</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>SwordSmashKnight</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Chivalric Charge</PowerName2>
		<Strength>5</Strength>
		<Dexterity>4</Dexterity>
		<Weight>8</Weight>
		<Speed>3</Speed>
		<BioText>Since the Norman Conquest, no knight has won more tournaments than Sir Roland Lansley, nor has any knight broken more hearts. Born to minor nobility on the verge of poverty, he fought his way to fame in jousts and battle royales across England. When war came, he proved even more formidable in the field of battle, becoming The King’s Favorite. No one in Valhalla feels a greater thirst for victory in the tournament than Sir Roland. He rejoices with every win and rages at every loss.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Sword</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Steampunk">
		<HeroID>12</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>SCARLET</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>SCARBOT</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>HammerUser,LanceUser,Female</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Scarlet</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>Evelyn_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Steampunk</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Evelyn</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>Hammer</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>HammerSmashSteampunk</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Centrifugal Force</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>RocketLance</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>LanceSmashSteampunk</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Boiling Point</PowerName2>
		<Strength>8</Strength>
		<Dexterity>4</Dexterity>
		<Weight>4</Weight>
		<Speed>4</Speed>
		<BioText>Famed inventor and foe to evil masterminds the world over, Scarlet and her steam-powered contraptions saved the world on multiple occasions. From her apprenticeship aboard the Nautilus to her command of the Royal Airship Fleet, Scarlet blasted a path through the Victorian age, leaving fallen madmen and defeated Atlantean armies in her wake. Since arriving in Valhalla, she’s been obsessed with the wondrous technology of the gods, and loves introducing experimental new weapons and gadgets into the tournament.</BioText>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Thatch">
		<HeroID>13</HeroID>
