		<PowerName1>Clear the Decks</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Pistol</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>PistolSmashPirate</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Broadside</PowerName2>
		<Strength>7</Strength>
		<Dexterity>4</Dexterity>
		<Weight>3</Weight>
		<Speed>6</Speed>
		<BioText>No pirate ever took more prizes or made more mayhem on the high seas than Captain Thatch.  His love of black powder and obsession with setting the world aflame combined to sink hundreds of ships, sack dozens of ports, and prematurely erupt at least two volcanoes. For Thatch, the Tournament of Valhalla is a paradise of constant chaos and explosions. He constantly pushes that chaos out of the arena, from pranks to outright traps for his fellow Legends.</BioText>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Cyber">
		<HeroID>14</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>ADA</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>ADROID</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>PistolUser,SpearUser,Female</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Ada</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[450]UA_H_Up</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Cyber</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Ada</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>Pistol</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>PistolSmashPunk</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Parting Shots</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Spear</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>SpearSmashPunk</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>Bot Buster</PowerName2>
		<Strength>6</Strength>
		<Dexterity>6</Dexterity>
		<Weight>3</Weight>
		<Speed>5</Speed>
		<BioText>Ada hacked her way free from the sub-slums beneath the Midwest Mega Arcology, smashing an army of D-Corp Security Drones on her way out. In the undersea free state of Miami Dome, she founded the Right Wrong Cavaliers, whose mindworm musical assaults provided cover for her masterful guerilla campaign against GogNet and the Upload Enslavement Initiative. She’s pretty sure Valhalla is all some sort of computer sim, but until she can find a way out, she’s playing to win.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Pistol</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Super">
		<HeroID>15</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>SENTINEL</HeroDisplayName>
		<BotDisplayName>BOTINEL</BotDisplayName>
		<MissionTags>HammerUser,KatarUser,Male</MissionTags>
		<NameSound>Name_Sentinel</NameSound>
		<OnSelectedSound>[420]Random_CS</OnSelectedSound>
		<CostumeName>Super</CostumeName>
		<TrailEffect>SmokeTrailEffect</TrailEffect>
		<IsActive>True</IsActive>
		<CanRandom>True</CanRandom>
		<Portrait>a_Roster_Pose_Super</Portrait>
		<BaseWeapon1>Hammer</BaseWeapon1>
		<SpecialPower1>HammerSmashSuper</SpecialPower1>
		<PowerName1>Arc of Justice</PowerName1>
		<BaseWeapon2>Katar</BaseWeapon2>
		<SpecialPower2>KatarSmashSuper</SpecialPower2>
		<PowerName2>System Overload</PowerName2>
		<Strength>5</Strength>
		<Dexterity>3</Dexterity>
		<Weight>7</Weight>
		<Speed>5</Speed>
		<BioText>Henry Coates, AKA Sentinel, was a born and raised New Yorker who gave up a normal life to become the country’s first costumed crime fighter. Using just his homemade electro-weapons and his wits, he exposed a conspiracy of corruption and launched a war against the criminal secret society known as KABAL. Videos of his heroism online made him world-famous, and his final confrontation with the sinister Master Zed inspired millions to fight for justice. For him, Valhalla is a blessed relief, a place to indulge his hard-won talents without worry and compete with other great fighters.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Katar</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
	<HeroType HeroName="Highwayman">
		<HeroID>9</HeroID>
		<HeroDisplayName>LUCIEN</HeroDisplayName>
