		<PowerName2>Coup de Grâce</PowerName2>
		<Strength>3</Strength>
		<Dexterity>5</Dexterity>
		<Weight>5</Weight>
		<Speed>7</Speed>
		<BioText>Master spy and deadly duelist Lucien Davout stalked the shadows of the French Revolution as an agent of The Terror. A Gascon Bandit, he took full advantage of the chaos of revolution to rise to riches over the bodies of fallen nobles and rivals. He played the double-agent during the Napoleonic Wars, dueling to the death any who dared accuse him of treachery. In the end it took an army of angry Russians to end him. In Valhalla he continues to scheme, and knows the tournament is the surest way to win influence here. He’ll resort to any means necessary to win.</BioText>
		<PaperDollWeapon>Pistol</PaperDollWeapon>
	</HeroType>
